{"author":"RebarBotNava","author_email":"joeoakhart+bot@navapbc.com","author_id":"594c-9dcf-5ad6-4e6d","author_sig":"{\"payload\": \"\", \"payloadType\": \"application/vnd.rebar.authorship.v1+json\", \"signatures\": [{\"keyid\": \"594c-9dcf-5ad6-4e6d\", \"sig\": \"\"}]}","data":{"body":"Strengthened the clean-but-ahead continuity contract: the entrypoint always delegates after optional commit; successful clean/ahead delivery creates no empty commit; persistent rejection under strict preserves the local commit and raises the dependency-defined PushDeliveryError, with the module CLI returning nonzero rather than success."},"env_id":"ade0f2ef-51cc-45a2-bb97-c09846cd3df5","event_type":"COMMENT","timestamp":1786147426572325001,"uuid":"835d41f3-f020-46c8-8dc7-065507d30290"}